{"title":"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3179d101e9a87e58d434be2f60d26178101a5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5 + 4 - 3}{5 + 4 + 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"78\" height=\"40\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b4d93a9ade8d46b99e047d6f08392ce649fe74b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ -1 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\frac{1}{3} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\frac{1}{2} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ -\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"444\" height=\"38\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluating the numerator and denominator, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/7/6170db19d369666580febeafb8527f131347be9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5 + 4 - 3}{5 + 4 + 3} = \\frac{9 - 3}{9 + 3} = \\frac{6}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"193\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying this gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/5/52581b5f7510592fc3e88a294431a3b8925249df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6 \\div 6}{12 \\div 6} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } \\frac{1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"140\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) P